>Chizuka</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Murashige</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Tanimoto</surname><given-names>TE</given-names></name><name><surname>Matsumara</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Yuji</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Yuji</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Wake</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Miyakoshi</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Morinaga</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Taniguchi</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><collab>Tokyo Stem Cell Transplant (SCT) Consortium</collab></person-group><article-title>Disseminated tuberculosis following reduced-intensity cord blood transplantation for patients with hematological diseases</article-title><source>Bone Marrow Transplant</source><year>2005</year><volume>35</volume><fpage>321</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1038/sj.bmt.1704824</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Sahn</surname><given-names>SA</given-names></name><name><surname>Lakshminarayan</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Tuberculosis after corticosteroid therapy</article-title><source>Br J Dis Chest</source><year>1976</year><volume>70</volume><fpage>195</fpage><lpage>205</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">136264</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/0007-0971(76)90029-2</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kim</surname><given-names>DK</given-names></name><name><surname>Lee</surname><given-names>SW</given-names></name><name><surname>Ko</surname><given-names>DS</given-names></name><name><surname>Yoo</surname><given-names>CG</given-names></name><name><surname>Kim</surname><given-names>YW</given-names></name><n